  "releaseNotes": "v2.3.1: documentation and packaging patch - every public member now carries XML documentation (CS1591 is enforced as a build error) and the README was reviewed for accuracy. Previous release: v2.3.0 - AddLinKitGrpc(baseAddress) is the single composition root - it registers the channel provider plus default interceptor provider, metadata provider and client factory, and still lets a later registration override any of them. AddGrpcChannel remains for callers that compose their own graph. Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
